# Input

```yaml
{"key": # comment after the colon
  value}
---
{? key # explicit
 : value}
---
{ ? key # on the key line
 # on its own line
 : v }
---
{ ? [a, b] # collection
 : v }
---
{"one" # 1
:value, "two" # 2
: v2}
---
a:
  b: {"key" # nested
    :value}
---
- {"key" # in a sequence
  :value}
---
[key: # single pair
 v]
---
[? key # explicit single pair
 : v]
---
{ ? key # on the key line
  : # on the colon line
    value }
---
{ key: # after the colon
 # on its own line
 value }

```


# Formatted

```yaml
{ ? "key" # comment after the colon
  : value }
---
{ ? key # explicit
  : value }
---
{
  ? key # on the key line
  # on its own line
  : v,
}
---
{ ? [a, b] # collection
  : v }
---
